copyright notices have been preserved in LICENSE.

Modifications by the ctun authors include (and will include): a TCP Fast
Open option on every emitted SYN, a pluggable Transport interface, a
ChaCha20-Poly1305 + HKDF + anti-replay security stack, automatic firewall
management, and a fixed binary wire format replacing paqet's encoding/gob.
